          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "व्याख्यान (vyākhyān) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit vyākhyāna, \"comment, narration\" (CDIAL 12188); the same entry lists an inherited Marathi vākhāṇ, \"praise\"."
            }
          ]
        },
